1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:00,751
Camera on.

2
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:07,466
Hunter's camera is off. As usual.
First item: the restructure.

3
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:10,007
<i>Empty. Of course.</i>

4
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:17,399
Hi. I'm Hunter. Some of you know me as
the Ops guy who eats chalk.

5
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:20,161
<i>He's doing it.</i>

6
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:26,884
Hunter Cole. I run Lumen. I came down
here to meet the people on a layoff
list.

7
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:31,703
And I lied to one of you. A lot.

8
00:00:31,823 --> 00:00:33,267
<i>Way more than three.</i>

9
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:38,557
So. The restructure's off. Nobody on
this floor is going anywhere.

10
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:42,055
The board's on this call, Grant. I
forwarded them your text.

11
00:00:44,150 --> 00:00:45,485
The one about the photos.

12
00:00:45,605 --> 00:00:46,753
<i>He actually did it.</i>

13
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:50,703
<i>Best. Monday. Ever.</i>

14
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:56,262
Starting next month, everybody gets a
monthly credit on Groupon. Go do
something you've never done.

15
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:07,766
<i>Recused. He stayed out of it.</i>

16
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,834
Tell me you didn't touch this.

17
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,129
Didn't touch it. Retired.

18
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:20,719
<i>Food walk, twenty-nine bucks. He's not
paying.</i>

19
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:22,563
Oh, this is you.

20
00:01:22,683 --> 00:01:23,634
It's orange.

21
00:01:23,754 --> 00:01:25,063
It's rust. It's you.

22
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,336
What do I owe you?

23
00:01:27,456 --> 00:01:29,221
Twelve. I'm keeping a tab.

24
00:01:29,341 --> 00:01:30,354
Where?

25
00:01:30,474 --> 00:01:32,307
The fridge. Obviously.

26
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:39,155
I was wrong about you. About… people
with money. Kind of.

27
00:01:39,275 --> 00:01:40,263
Kind of?

28
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:44,997
Don't push it. Lisbon jar's at sixty
percent. Need a travel buddy.

29
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:46,880
I'll pay my own way.

30
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,948
Obviously. Still a project.

31
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:52,286
So. What're we doing next weekend?

32
00:01:52,900 --> 00:01:58,268
<i>Twelve-dollar sweater. No watch. No
idea what time it is.</i>

33
00:01:58,900 --> 00:02:00,827
I don't know. Something I've never
done.

34
00:02:00,947 --> 00:02:01,584
Okay.
